<hr>
<h3 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-BenefitsList">Benefits List</h3>
<p>(aka Services List)</p>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p>Feature Flag: <strong>MedPlanSumm</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-689110817" class=3D"expand-container">
<div id=3D"expander-control-689110817" class=3D"expand-control">
<span class=3D"expand-control-icon"><img style=3D"vertical-align:middle;" c=
lass=3D"expand-control-image" src=3D"5aea008bb975d458a27ed295da8ede75c87d22=
51f7647814af828080dee2b0b2" width=3D"16" height=3D"16"></span><span class=
=3D"expand-control-text">rollupBenefitList API</span>
</div>
<div id=3D"expander-content-689110817" class=3D"expand-content">
<p>API: <code>rollupbenefitlist</code></p>
<p>Endpoint: <code>v4/aetnahealth_memberships/{membershipResourceId}/rollup=
benefitlist?benefitProductType=3D{type}</code></p>
<p><strong>Params:</strong></p>
<p><code>type</code> can be <code>Medical</code>, <code>Dental</code>, or <=
code>Executive Medical</code></p>
<p><code>membershipResourceId</code> is the membershipResourceId for the po=
licy type</p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>Per the new design, the benefits list renders the rollupGroups in ascend=
ing order based off of their <code>sequenceNumber</code> with each group us=
ing the Tile component. Within those Tiles, the services are in a list with=
 their <code>groupText</code>as the heading (h3), <code>description</code> =
as the paragraph before it, and a View Details button that links to the cor=
responding Service Detail page.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-=
wrapper image-center-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image=
-center" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"90e5d21b62ecf85dd4744face3ecc8ac3eaa263aa1=
d7470d8254abf3f58c0658" data-image-src=3D"https://cvsdigital.atlassian.net/=
wiki/download/attachments/2150170734/Screen%20Shot%202021-10-25%20at%202.37=
.00%20PM.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1635190633781&amp;cacheVers=
ion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"777" data-width=3D"819" data-unresolve=
d-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2156298390" data-linked-re=
source-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-r=
esource-default-alias=3D"Screen Shot 2021-10-25 at 2.37.00 PM.png" data-bas=
e-url=3D"https://cvsdigital.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-conten=
t-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2150170734" data-=
linked-resource-container-version=3D"31" data-media-id=3D"cdbc8114-9aaa-407=
a-b430-b0fe42e13286" data-media-type=3D"file" width=3D"468" height=3D"444">=
</span>
<p></p>
<h4 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-Components">Components</h4>
<h4 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-EdgeCaseScenarios">Edge Case Scenarios</h4>
<p>Members that have Flex Five or Upfront Advantage (observed by the <code>=
groupID</code>) will see a <code>CalloutTile</code> that renders instead of=
 a <code>ServiceTile</code>. It renders <code>costDetails</code> from the g=
roup data that includes a description of the benefit and cost details.</p>
