<hr>
<h3 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-ServiceDetails">Service Details</h3>
<p>This is a new page that shows all of the data for each service coming fr=
om the initial <code>rollupbenefistlist</code> api call. Since the service =
names are not guaranteed to be unique across rollupGroups, we combine it wi=
th the <code>groupID</code> to ensure the routes are unique. The routes are=
 created using the following pattern <code>/benefits/medical-plan-summary/$=
{groupID}${rollupBenefitText}</code></p>
<p>The route params are used to determine which data to be rendered from th=
e <code>rollupbenefitlist</code> response.</p>
<h4 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-Components.1">Components</h4>
<p>One =E2=80=9Ctier=E2=80=9D:</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-w=
