<h4 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-EdgeCaseScenarios.1">Edge Case Scenarios</h4>
<p>NOTE: IVL members only see this tile on the <strong>Benefits</strong> pa=
ge.</p>
<hr>
<h3 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-PlanVideo">Plan Video</h3>
<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p>Feature Flag: <strong>MedicareVideo</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<p>The PlanVideo tile looks the same for all users but has a different flow=
 based on the line of business when a user clicks on the =E2=80=9CWatch Vid=
eo=E2=80=9D button. While the feature flag is called <strong>MedicareVideo<=
/strong>, it=E2=80=99s NOT specific to Medicare - we should consider renami=
ng it to SundaySkyVideo. Commercial users can have the flag on.</p>
<p>For Medicare, we open up an existing modal that is maintained by Horizon=
.</p>
<p>For Commercial, we open a microsite link.</p>
<p>The flow matches was is seen on the homepage.</p>
<h4 id=3D"MedicalCoverage-Web-Components.3">Components</h4><span class=3D"c=
